<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}
<p>Hi&nbsp;{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
<br />
Thank you for contacting Qantas Customer Care regarding your recent call.<br />
<br />
We believe a great journey starts with a great booking experience, so I was sorry to hear that you were given incorrect information by one of our consultants.<br />
<br />
We’ve always been committed to providing customers with a premium, professional and helpful service, so I understand your disappointment.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-if a frequent flyer</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’ve credited {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to your Frequent Flyer account.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<em><strong>-if not a Frequent Flyer</strong></em><br />
<br />
As a gesture of goodwill, I’d like to arrange a credit of {{{Case.Recovery_Quantity__c}}} Qantas Points to you.<br />
<br />
Please can you let me know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so I can credit points to your account. If you’re not already a member you can use this&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a>&nbsp;to join free of charge.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with an exceptional experience from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed on your feedback to the relevant team for review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and I hope we deliver an exceptional service next time you speak with one of our consultants.</p>
</body>
</html>